# Elegant Terracotta Design System

**Canonical spec:** [`docs/design-system/elegant-terracotta.md`](../../docs/design-system/elegant-terracotta.md)  
**Token allowlist:** [`docs/design-system/tokens.ts`](../../docs/design-system/tokens.ts)

## Typography

| Role | Class | Font |
|------|-------|------|
| Headings (22px+) | `font-heading` | Playfair Display |
| Body / UI (10–14px) | `font-body` | Inter |

**React Native:** `tailwind.config.js` must use a **single** font family per token (e.g. `Inter`, not `Inter, sans-serif`). CSS font stacks break `TextInput` on Android (`fontFamily` must be a string).

Mobile: prefer `AppText` from `@/components/ui` with `variant="heading" | "body" | "caption" | "label"`.

## Dialogs and alerts (mobile)

- **Do not** use `Alert.alert` from `react-native` or browser `alert()` in `BookMyBarber-App`.
- Use `appAlert()` from `@/lib/app-alert` (requires `AppDialogProvider` in `src/app/_layout.tsx`).
- Soft, non-blocking state (e.g. location fallback) → inline banner with `text-muted-foreground`, not a modal.
- Spec: [`docs/design-system/elegant-terracotta.md`](../../docs/design-system/elegant-terracotta.md) § Dialogs and feedback.

## Colors (semantic only in `.tsx`)

| Intent | Classes |
|--------|---------|
| Page canvas | `bg-background` |
| Body text | `text-foreground` |
| Secondary text | `text-muted-foreground` |
| Card | `bg-card border border-border` |
| Primary CTA | `bg-primary text-primary-foreground` |
| Destructive | `bg-destructive text-destructive-foreground` |
| Admin sidebar | `bg-sidebar text-sidebar-foreground` |
| Active nav | `text-sidebar-primary border-sidebar-primary` |
| Charts | `text-chart-1` … `text-chart-5` or `CHART` constants |

**Do not** add raw hex in component files. Exception: token/CSS definition files only.

